[Flatpak Repo]
Title=SeeMyMac
Url=https://kestermckinney.github.io/SeeMyMac/flatpak/
Homepage=https://github.com/kestermckinney/SeeMyMac
Comment=Remote desktop client for Macs
Description=Official Flatpak repository for SeeMyMac. Add this remote to install SeeMyMac and receive updates via `flatpak update`.
Icon=https://kestermckinney.github.io/SeeMyMac/flatpak/icon.png
# Single-line, base64-encoded public half of the repo signing key
# (packaging/linux/seemymac.gpg): base64 --wrap=0 packaging/linux/seemymac.gpg
# packaging/ci/build-flatpak-release.sh refuses to publish if the two differ.

